[2026-05-20T18:49:22.003Z] [STDOUT] ## Summary
Fixes #6.

- Adds `lino-i18n` as the i18n dependency and uses a `.lino` catalog as the translation source of truth.
- Compiles the Lino catalog into typed runtime catalogues before dev, production build, and Pages export builds.
- Replaces JSON translation loading with `createI18n`, English fallback handling, and persisted locale selection.
- Adds active Bengali, Kannada, Marathi, Tamil, and Telugu locale support alongside English and Hindi.
- Updates the language selector, footer, and additional catalog-backed page copy to use the i18n runtime.

## Visual verification

![Expanded locale dropdown](https://github.com/Svetozar-Technologies/SatyaVera/blob/issue-6-de10f9c88439/docs/screenshots/i18n-locales-dropdown.png?raw=true)

## Verification

- `npm run lint` passes with 18 existing warnings in unrelated files.
- `npx tsc --noEmit`
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY=... NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=... NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=... NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=... NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=... NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_APP_ID=... npm run build`
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY=... NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=... NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=... NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=... NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=... NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_APP_ID=... npm run build:pages`
- Playwright: opened the landing page, expanded the language selector, and verified all seven locales are present.

## Notes

Local production builds without public Firebase environment variables still fail during prerender with `auth/invalid-api-key`; dummy public Firebase values were used to validate the build and export paths.

